---
description: Use agent-skills workflows from .cursor/skills
alwaysApply: true
---

Before non-trivial technical work:

1. Route via `.cursor/skills/using-agent-skills/SKILL.md`.
2. Read and follow the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.
3. Open `reference.md` or `references/` in that folder when the skill links to it.
4. Prefer project skills over guessing.
5. For design, brainstorm, spec review, drift, or any EGM request, read `.cursor/skills/using-agent-skills/egm-routing.md` and the matching `egm-*` skill. `egm-brainstorm` disables model auto-invocation; open it anyway when the task is a brainstorm or design pass. `EGM_ROOT` is `.cursor/egm`.
